    <string name="limits_title">How it works and limits</string>
    <string name="limits_body">• Needs the call-screening role — it replaces another screening app such as a caller-ID app.\n• Do Not Disturb modes that block alarms can still silence the alert.\n• If Do Not Disturb already lets this caller ring you, you may hear both.\n• Volume keys stop the alert only while the Leviro caller card is focused; otherwise use Stop in the notification.\n• Some phone makers stop background apps unless battery optimization is off and auto-start is allowed.\n• Hidden caller IDs cannot be matched.</string>
